  <div class="lang-en">
    <p class="doc-note">
      TCG XChange is a free community project run by a private individual. For any privacy questions or GDPR requests (access, correction, deletion), email <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Data Controller</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Controller:</strong> Private individual operating TCG XChange</li>
      <li><strong>Contact Email:</strong> <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a></li>
      <li><strong>Applicable Law:</strong> EU General Data Protection Regulation (<strong>GDPR</strong> — Regulation (EU) 2016/679) and Hungarian Act CXII of 2011 on the Right of Informational Self-Determination and on Freedom of Information (<strong>Infotv.</strong>).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. Using the Site Without an Account</h2>
    <p>
      You can browse the catalog, track a collection, and build decks without signing up. That data stays in your browser's local storage (see the <a href="/legal/cookies">Cookie notice</a>) and is never transmitted to our servers.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Data We Process When You Have an Account, Purposes &amp; Legal Bases</h2>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Category of Data</th>
          <th>Purpose</th>
          <th>Legal Basis (GDPR Art. 6)</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Account data:</strong> email address, password (stored only as a secure hash by our auth provider), display name, avatar, join date.</td>
          <td>Providing your account, sign-in, and public profile.</td>
          <td>Performance of a contract — Art. 6(1)(b)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Collections, decks &amp; wishlists:</strong> tracked cards, named collections, auto-list and shipping settings.</td>
          <td>Cloud sync across devices and managing marketplace listings.</td>
          <td>Performance of a contract — Art. 6(1)(b)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Marketplace trades &amp; messages:</strong> listings, photos, hold requests, delivery details (name, phone number, address or parcel locker), trade messages, completed orders, reviews.</td>
          <td>Connecting buyers and sellers, facilitating handover, and maintaining community trust via trade reviews.</td>
          <td>Performance of a contract — Art. 6(1)(b); Legitimate interest (fraud prevention) — Art. 6(1)(f)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Technical &amp; usage counts:</strong> listing view/click counters, anonymous catalog search terms, short-lived server logs (IP address).</td>
          <td>Keeping the platform secure and showing sellers anonymous demand statistics.</td>
          <td>Legitimate interest — Art. 6(1)(f)</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p>We do not sell your personal data, display advertisements, or use third-party advertising or behavioral tracking scripts.</p>

    <h2>4. Who Can See What</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Public:</strong> your display name, avatar, member-since date, completed sales/purchases counts, ratings, reviews, active listings, and published decks.</li>
      <li><strong>Your counterparty in a trade:</strong> your hold request, the delivery/handover details you entered for it, and your messages. Delivery details are only shared with the specific seller you are ordering from.</li>
      <li><strong>Only you:</strong> your email address, private collections, private decks, and wishlists.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Data Processors &amp; Infrastructure</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Cloudflare Inc.</strong> (101 Townsend St, San Francisco, CA 94107, USA) — web hosting, edge runtime, global CDN, and Cloudflare R2 card image storage; processes short-lived technical logs including IP addresses.</li>
      <li><strong>Supabase Inc.</strong> (970 Toa Payoh North #07-04, Singapore 318992) — database and authentication services, hosted in the <strong>European Union (Frankfurt, Germany)</strong>.</li>
      <li><strong>External Card &amp; Image Content Delivery Networks (CDNs)</strong> — certain external card artwork (e.g. One Piece Card Game, Disney Lorcana, Star Wars: Unlimited, Flesh and Blood) and game glyphs (Riot Games Inc.) are fetched directly from external game or community content servers, which receive standard HTTP connection data (IP address, user-agent) to deliver the image.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>6. Retention Periods</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Account &amp; collection data:</strong> retained for as long as you maintain an account. If you request account deletion, your account and linked personal data are deleted within <strong>30 days</strong>.</li>
      <li><strong>Completed trade records:</strong> when an account is deleted, personal shipping details on past orders are removed/anonymized while preserving aggregate trade history for the counterparty.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>7. Your GDPR Rights &amp; Supervisory Authority (NAIH)</h2>
    <p>Under Articles 15–21 of the GDPR, you have the right to request:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Access</strong> to and a copy of the personal data we hold about you (you can also export your collection directly from the Catalog);</li>
      <li><strong>Rectification</strong> of inaccurate data;</li>
      <li><strong>Erasure</strong> ("right to be forgotten") or <strong>restriction</strong> of processing;</li>
      <li><strong>Data portability</strong> and the right to <strong>object</strong> to processing based on legitimate interest.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Send requests to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> and we will respond within <strong>30 days</strong>. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with the Hungarian data protection authority:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Authority:</strong> Nemzeti Adatvédelmi és Információszabadság Hatóság (<strong>NAIH</strong>)</li>
      <li><strong>Address:</strong> 1055 Budapest, Falk Miksa utca 9-11., Hungary</li>
      <li><strong>Email:</strong> <code>ugyfelszolgalat@naih.hu</code> — <strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://naih.hu" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://naih.hu</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
